# Run a pallet transport mission: pick at one dock, drop at another, optionally drive to a return pose.
# One mission at a time: a second goal while a mission is active is rejected.
# Cancel: the active child goal is cancelled, the robot is stopped, the fork is left where it is
# (held), the result is error_code "CANCELED".
# Timeouts (parameters of the mission node): per navigation, per dock, per mission.

# Goal
string mission_id                         # free text, echoed in feedback / status
string mission_type                       # "PALLET_TRANSPORT" (only type so far)
string pick_dock_id                       # dock database entry with operation pick
string drop_dock_id                       # dock database entry with operation drop
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped return_pose     # empty header.frame_id = do not drive back

---
# Result
# error_code: "" (success) | INVALID_MISSION | MISSION_TIMEOUT | CANCELED | NAV_FAILED |
#   or the DockPallet error code of the failed step (STAGING_FAILED, MARKER_NOT_FOUND,
#   LIFT_FAILED, ALIGN_FAILED, TIMEOUT, ...)
# failed_step: VALIDATE | PICK | DROP | RETURN ("" on success)
bool success
string error_code
string failed_step
string message

---
# Feedback
string mission_id
string state                              # VALIDATE | PICK | DROP | RETURN | DONE
int32 step_index                          # 1-based
int32 total_steps
float32 progress                          # 0..100
string message
